.TH FMT_HEXBS 3
.SH NAME
fmt_hexbs \- format bytes as a space-separated hexadecimal string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <fmt.h>
.P
.BI "size_t fmt_hexbs(void* " out ", const void* " d ", size_t " len ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR fmt_hexbs ()
converts
.I len
bytes from
.I d
into a space-separated hexadecimal representation, writing the result to
.IR out .
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of bytes written.